  "description": "Located in well established Ballymacool area of Letterkenny, we are thrilled to offer this delightfully maintained three bedroom mid-terraced property available to rent which is sure to appeal to a wide range of potential tenants given its proximity to Letterkenny main street as well as multiple amenities, schools, cafes, schools and leisure facilities. \n\nThe property has been exceptionally well maintained throughout and the layout comprises of spacious open plan living room / sitting room, kitchen / dining room with fully fitted units, two spacious double bedrooms with built in wardrobes, single bedroom and a fully tiled shower room whilst the property also boasts the following; \n\n* Oil fired central heating \n* Open Fireplace \n* On street parking \n\n* Eircode F92 DR7T \n\nReferences required \n\nDeposit €1,300.00 \n\nViewings by appointment only",
